# ovnctl — File Reference

A per-file description of the ovnctl suite: a Python port of an OVN/OVS
deployment, diagnostic and teardown shell suite. Single executable, one
subcommand per original script, every subcommand split into named steps.

Python 3.9+, standard library only. No PyYAML, no third-party packages.

---

