### Layering

Nothing below a line imports from above it.

```
commands/*          ← the work
    ↓
identity, inventory, libvirtutil, ovn, netcalc, steps   ← domain helpers
    ↓
context, config, state                                  ← execution + data
    ↓
paths                                                   ← where things live
```

`cli.py` sits outside this stack: it builds the parser, constructs the
`Ctx`, and dispatches into `commands/`.

